-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What this license covers
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the work of the authors of this repository, among
others: Audio System Design Tool++ (the editor, the export, the live control),
FPB (red/fpb/, fpb/ including the Teensy library fpb/teensy/FPB, and
specs/fpb-bytecode.md), the examples, components and test designs.

Code from other projects keeps its own license, as stated in its files:

- Files derived from Node-RED (Copyright IBM Corp. and other contributors),
  via the original Audio System Design Tool by PJRC: Apache License 2.0.
  These files have the Apache license header.
- Third-party libraries included in this repository:
  - jquery/, bootstrap/, font-awesome/, orion/, red/ui/ace/, jzz/, and the
    single files slip.js and osc-browser.js: their own licenses (MIT, BSD,
    Apache 2.0, SIL OFL, Eclipse Public License (orion/)), see the files.
  - jscolor.js: GPLv3 for open source use (or a commercial license from its
    author). The rest of this repository is MIT and can be used without it;
    a closed source derivative would have to replace the color picker.
